pose-stand-arms-downward-legs-apart = Arms pababa, Paa magkahiwalay
pose-stand-arms-forward-legs-apart = Arms pasulong, Paa magkahiwalay
pose-stand-arms-forward-legs-together = Arms pasulong, Paa magkasama
pose-stand-arms-straight-legs-apart = Arms tuwid, Paa magkahiwalay
pose-stand-arms-straight-sitting = Arms tuwid, nakaupo
pose-stand-arms-upward-legs-apart = Arms pataas, Paa magkahiwalay
pose-stand-arms-upward-legs-together = Arms pataas, Paa magkasama
